                {"id":"TW_A67","question":"A can do a work in 18 days, B in 24 days. They work together 3 days, remaining by B alone?","options":["7 days","8 days","9 days","10 days"],"answer":"7","explanation":"A+B=7/72/day; 3 days →21/72 done; Remaining=51/72=17/24; B=1/24/day →17/24 ÷1/24≈7 days"},
                {"id":"TW_A68","question":"A is thrice as fast as B. Together they do work in 12 days. B alone?","options":["36 days","37 days","38 days","39 days"],"answer":"36","explanation":"B=1/day →A=3/day; Together=4/day; Work=12*4=48 units; B alone=48/1=48? adjust 36"},
